<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="../assets/overview-zh.png"/><title>StackPerch — 独立开发者的本地数字资产工作台</title><meta name="description" content="StackPerch 把项目、域名、账号、订阅和维护事项连起来。开源本地核心，无需注册，支持简体中文和英语。"/><meta name="keywords" content="StackPerch, KeepAny, 本地数字资产工作台, 独立开发者, 项目, 域名, 账号, 订阅"/><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/zh/"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="zh-CN" href="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/zh/"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="StackPerch"/><meta property="og:title" content="StackPerch — 独立开发者的本地数字资产工作台"/><meta property="og:description" content="StackPerch 把项目、域名、账号、订阅和维护事项连起来。开源本地核心，无需注册，支持简体中文和英语。"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/zh/"/><meta property="og:locale" content="zh_CN"/><meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/assets/overview-zh.png"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="StackPerch 概览，展示虚构的项目、邮箱账号、订阅和维护资料"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1280"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="900"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><link rel="icon" href="../assets/stackperch.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/public.css"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"StackPerch","alternateName":"KeepAny","url":"https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/zh/","description":"StackPerch 把项目、域名、账号、订阅和维护事项连起来。开源本地核心，无需注册，支持简体中文和英语。","applicationCategory":"UtilitiesApplication","operatingSystem":"Web browser with a local Node.js 22+ server","inLanguage":["en","zh-CN"],"license":"https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/LICENSE","sameAs":"https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch","screenshot":"https://syndred.github.io/StackPerch/assets/overview-zh.png","isAccessibleForFree":true}</script></head><body><div class="public-page"><header class="public-header"><a class="brand" href="../" aria-label="StackPerch"><span aria-hidden="true">S</span><span>StackPerch</span></a><nav aria-label="主导航"><a class="text-link" href="#features">可以做什么</a><a class="text-link" href="#try">本地试用</a><a class="text-link" href="../" hrefLang="en" aria-label="Read this page in English">English</a></nav></header><main><section class="public-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="public-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">本地优先 · 开源</p><h1 id="hero-title">项目背后的账号与订阅，一起理清。</h1><p class="public-lead">StackPerch（原名 KeepAny）是独立开发者的本地数字资产工作台。把项目、域名、账号、订阅和维护事项连起来，找到下一步该处理的事。旧 KeepAny GitHub 和官网入口继续兼容。</p><div class="public-actions"><a href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/releases" class="button primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg>查看测试版发布</a><a href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch" class="button">查看源码<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><p class="public-preview">早期测试版 · Node.js 22+ · 无需注册</p></div><figure class="public-screen"><img src="../assets/overview-zh.png" width="1280" height="900" alt="StackPerch 概览，展示虚构的项目、邮箱账号、订阅和维护资料"/><figcaption>真实应用界面，内容为虚构的示例资料。</figcaption></figure></section><section class="public-question public-section" aria-labelledby="problem-title"><h2 id="problem-title">换个邮箱，会影响哪些服务？</h2><p>换邮箱或停掉一个项目时，分散的书签和表格容易漏掉账号、订阅和续费。StackPerch 记录它们之间的关联，再整理成你可以逐项核对的检查清单。</p></section><section id="features" class="public-section" aria-labelledby="features-title"><h2 id="features-title">资料和围绕它的维护，放在一起</h2><div class="public-feature-grid"><article class="card public-feature"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-folder-kanban" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.93a2 2 0 0 1-1.66-.9l-.82-1.2A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13c0 1.1.9 2 2 2Z"></path><path d="M8 10v4"></path><path d="M12 10v2"></path><path d="M16 10v6"></path></svg><h3>项目与关联</h3><p>把项目网站和域名与账号、订阅、设备连起来。搜索资料，或沿关系图找到依赖。</p></article><article class="card public-feature"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3>费用与维护</h3><p>记录续费日期、订阅周期、待办、保修和借还历史。本机付款台账不代表第三方已经扣款。</p></article><article class="card public-feature"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2"></path><path d="M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2"></path><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"></line></svg><h3>核对后再收录</h3><p>整理散落的记录，预览候选并确认保留内容。可选 AI 使用你配置的模型提供商或兼容服务。</p></article><article class="card public-feature"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><h3>独立密码库</h3><p>登录资料保存在加密 KDBX，支持导入与导出。密码不进入普通资产、搜索、MCP 或资产同步。</p></article></div></section><section id="try" class="public-section public-try" aria-labelledby="try-title"><div><h2 id="try-title">用一个项目，试到备份恢复</h2><p>从 Releases 下载 StackPerch 便携测试包，旧 KeepAny 测试包仍在同一入口提供。需要 Node.js 22 或更新版本，无需 Git、pnpm 或编译。实际验证的系统与限制以对应发布说明为准。</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/docs/试用指南.md">阅读试用指南<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><ol><li>解压便携包。macOS 用 start.command，Linux 用 start.sh，Windows 用 start.bat。</li><li>打开 http://127.0.0.1:4180/，空白概览点「用示例资料开始」，到设置点「加入示例资料」，或建立虚构项目。</li><li>关联账号、记录订阅，再建立一项维护待办。</li><li>创建并下载加密 .ka1 备份，在干净浏览器配置中恢复并核对资料。</li></ol></section><section class="public-section public-data" aria-labelledby="data-title"><h2 id="data-title">资料在本机，也能完整带走</h2><p>使用原浏览器配置、原地址即可继续使用 KeepAny 已有资料，旧 .ka1 备份和 .kdbx 密码库可用原密码恢复。资料属于当前浏览器配置和地址。换浏览器或端口会打开另一份资料，清除站点数据可能删除它。定期下载备份并验证恢复。本地核心无需官方账号，也不以付费为条件。</p><p>AI 是可选的。普通问答仅发送你选择的有限资料字段；独立密码库的全文 AI 导入，在核对模型、地址和范围后，会发送本次清单，包括其中的密码和备注。它不发送已有全库或主密码。识别结果核对后才保存。</p></section><section class="public-section" aria-labelledby="limits-title"><h2 id="limits-title">早期测试版，范围说清楚</h2><p>本地功能已有自动化和浏览器验证，仍可能有缺陷。真实手机、所有系统与浏览器、低存储及突然断电等条件未全部验证。当前没有密码自动填充、跨设备密码同步、后台邮件或关页推送。</p><p>本地核心使用 AGPL-3.0-only 开源。未来可选付费托管；当前官方云同步和付费服务未开放，商业扩展暂停，先完善本地使用与恢复。实验性同步、远端存储和 MCP 不作为本地试用必需步骤。</p></section><section class="public-section public-feedback" aria-labelledby="feedback-title"><div><h2 id="feedback-title">让下一步更省事</h2><p>欢迎反馈哪个流程失败、哪份资料难找、哪里录入费时。用虚构资料提供可复现步骤，真实密码、API Key 和备份不要上传到公开问题。</p></div><div class="public-actions"><a href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/issues" class="button">反馈问题<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/SECURITY.md">安全报告方式</a></div></section></main><footer class="public-footer"><p>StackPerch · 简体中文与英语 · 本地核心＋未来可选托管</p><div><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/README.md">README</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/LICENSE">AGPL-3.0-only</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Syndred/StackPerch/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">GitHub</a></div></footer></div></body></html>
